158 rebase (2026-10-04, against Firefox 158.0b3): player.xhtml no longer
gives the PiP buttons tabindex attributes; 158 orders the close/unpip buttons
by DOM position inside an #ifdef XP_MACOSX block instead. The piphide button
is inserted into both branches at the position its old tabindex gave it in
the focus order (macOS: close, piphide, unpip; elsewhere: unpip, close,
piphide). player.js and player.css are unchanged apart from offsets.

